<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Synchronization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">MCPWM<sp/>synchronization<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>crucial<sp/>feature<sp/>that<sp/>allows<sp/>multiple<sp/>PWM<sp/>modules<sp/>to<sp/>operate<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>coordinated<sp/>manner.<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Synchronization<sp/>Sources</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**External<sp/>Sync**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Input<sp/>XBAR<sp/>routing<sp/>for<sp/>external<sp/>sync<sp/>signals</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Configurable<sp/>sync<sp/>input<sp/>selection<sp/>(SYNCISEL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Edge-triggered<sp/>synchronization<sp/>events</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Internal<sp/>Sync**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Module-to-module<sp/>synchronization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Counter<sp/>synchronization<sp/>between<sp/>PWM<sp/>modules</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Cascaded<sp/>synchronization<sp/>chains<sp/>possible</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Sync<sp/>Mechanisms</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Time<sp/>Base<sp/>Synchronization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**TBCTL<sp/>Register<sp/>Controls**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>PHSEN<sp/>(Phase<sp/>Load<sp/>Enable)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`MCPWM_enablePhaseShiftLoad()`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`MCPWM_disablePhaseShiftLoad()`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>SYNCOSEL<sp/>(Sync<sp/>Output<sp/>Select)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`MCPWM_setSyncOutPulseMode()`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>SYNCISEL<sp/>(Sync<sp/>Input<sp/>Select)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`MCPWM_setSyncInPulseSource()`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>PHSDIR<sp/>(Phase<sp/>Direction)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>`MCPWM_setCountModeAfterSync()`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Sync<sp/>Out<sp/>Events,<sp/>see<sp/>enum<sp/>::MCPWM_SyncOutPulseMode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Sync<sp/>In<sp/>Sources,<sp/>see<sp/>enum<sp/>::MCPWM_SyncInPulseSource</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Phase<sp/>Control<sp/>Features</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Phase<sp/>Loading</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**TBPHS<sp/>Register**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>16-bit<sp/>phase<sp/>offset<sp/>value</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Loaded<sp/>on<sp/>sync<sp/>event<sp/>when<sp/>PHSEN<sp/>enabled</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Counter<sp/>Behavior</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Post-Sync<sp/>Options**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Software<sp/>configurable<sp/>direction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Force<sp/>UP<sp/>counting</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Force<sp/>DOWN<sp/>counting</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Runtime<sp/>Phase<sp/>Control</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Phase<sp/>offset<sp/>modifications<sp/>during<sp/>operation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Direction<sp/>control<sp/>after<sp/>synchronization</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Timing<sp/>Considerations</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Sync<sp/>Latency**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>One<sp/>PWM<sp/>clock<sp/>cycle<sp/>for<sp/>sync<sp/>recognition</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Counter<sp/>update<sp/>on<sp/>next<sp/>clock<sp/>edge</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Phase<sp/>Accuracy**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Resolution<sp/>based<sp/>on<sp/>PWM<sp/>clock</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Deterministic<sp/>phase<sp/>relationships</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">###<sp/>Applications</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Three-phase<sp/>inverter<sp/>control</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Interleaved<sp/>power<sp/>converters</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Multi-channel<sp/>motor<sp/>drives</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Example<sp/>Overview</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">These<sp/>examples<sp/>demonstrate<sp/>two<sp/>different<sp/>approaches<sp/>to<sp/>implement<sp/>MCPWM<sp/>synchronization<sp/>functionality:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Driverlib<sp/>Implementation<sp/>(mcpwm_ex2_synchronization.c<sp/>in<sp/>driverlib)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Direct<sp/>Register/Bitfield<sp/>Implementation<sp/>(mcpwm_ex2_synchronization.c<sp/>in<sp/>examples_bitfield)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Key<sp/>synchronization<sp/>features<sp/>demonstrated<sp/>in<sp/>this<sp/>example<sp/>include:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Sync<sp/>Mechanism**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>External<sp/>sync<sp/>input<sp/>through<sp/>InputXBAR</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Module-to-module<sp/>sync<sp/>(MCPWM1<sp/>to<sp/>MCPWM3)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Configurable<sp/>sync<sp/>events<sp/>(Period<sp/>match)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Phase<sp/>Control**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Dynamic<sp/>phase<sp/>shift<sp/>adjustments</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Phase<sp/>shift<sp/>loading<sp/>on<sp/>sync<sp/>events</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Configurable<sp/>counter<sp/>direction<sp/>after<sp/>sync</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>**Timing<sp/>Coordination**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Synchronized<sp/>counter<sp/>updates</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Phase-shifted<sp/>operation<sp/>of<sp/>recieving<sp/>module</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Common<sp/>Functionality</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Both<sp/>implementations<sp/>configure<sp/>myMCPWM0(MCPWM1)<sp/>and<sp/>myMCPWM1(MCPWM3)<sp/>with<sp/>synchronization<sp/>features:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>myMCPWM0<sp/>Configuration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Time<sp/>Base<sp/>Settings:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Up<sp/>Count<sp/>Mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>10KHz<sp/>Frequency<sp/>(15999<sp/>TBCLKs<sp/>for<sp/>160MHz<sp/>TBCLK)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Sync<sp/>input<sp/>enabled<sp/>from<sp/>InputXbar<sp/>5</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Phase<sp/>shift<sp/>load<sp/>enabled</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Sync<sp/>Out<sp/>configured<sp/>for<sp/>Counter<sp/>equals<sp/>Period<sp/>event</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Action<sp/>Qualifier<sp/>Outputs:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>on<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>on<sp/>CMPA<sp/>match</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>on<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>on<sp/>CMPB<sp/>match</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">3.<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>Configuration:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>ET2<sp/>triggers<sp/>every<sp/>5<sp/>&quot;Counter<sp/>=<sp/>Period&quot;<sp/>events</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Updates<sp/>phase<sp/>shift<sp/>values<sp/>at<sp/>runtime</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>myMCPWM1<sp/>Configuration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>Time<sp/>Base<sp/>Settings:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Up-Down<sp/>Count<sp/>Mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>10KHz<sp/>Frequency<sp/>(8000<sp/>TBCLKs<sp/>for<sp/>160MHz<sp/>TBCLK)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Sync<sp/>input<sp/>from<sp/>myMCPWM0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Phase<sp/>shift<sp/>load<sp/>enabled</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Configurable<sp/>counter<sp/>direction<sp/>after<sp/>sync</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>Action<sp/>Qualifier<sp/>Outputs:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>A1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>on<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>on<sp/>CMPA<sp/>match</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Output<sp/>B1:<sp/>Set<sp/>High<sp/>on<sp/>zero,<sp/>Low<sp/>on<sp/>CMPB<sp/>match</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
